<title>USA: Sandoz to up sales force by 464 people.</title>
<headline>Sandoz to up sales force by 464 people.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HANOVER, N.J. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sandoz AG's Sandoz Pharmaceuticals Corp said on Tuesday it planned to hire 464 permanent full-time salespeople for its prescription products.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the increase, which would double its sales force capacity in the primary care area, was partly driven by the success of certain prescription products.</p>
</text>
